        <item>
            <title>1.45.14</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>What's new in 1.45.14</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Value tiers can overlap freely in the library, but the tiers enabled for a service's pricing zone can no longer intersect — Save is blocked and the conflict is named.</li>
  <li>Item reordering on a category page is now saved (it previously reverted on reopen).</li>
  <li>Change-order list positions no longer reshuffle after document actions.</li>
  <li>Per-service pricing-zone settings: the "unsaved changes" indicator now appears only for real edits and clears after saving; added a "Decline changes" button.</li>
  <li>Client id is included in the proposal and change-order payloads.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
