        <item>
            <title>1.45.13</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h3>What's new in 1.45.13</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Value tiers and incentives are configured per pricing zone on each service, so discount caps apply per geographic zone again.</li>
  <li>Combined incentive cap now has a global default, overridable per service. Creating a proposal outside the cap shows a dialog naming the active cap, and a proposal below the minimum needs an approved exception.</li>
  <li>Submit Sale no longer shows an error when the submit actually succeeds.</li>
  <li>Fixed subcategory reordering that could loop or hang on a spinner.</li>
  <li>Incentive cards shake when dragged past their own limit; per-service/zone settings can't be saved when the incentive ranges don't fit the cap.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
